# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Character design / SVG rendering assets.
# NOTE: src/ imports SOME of these at build time via Vite (?raw / ?url), so
# those specific files MUST be committed or the production build fails.
# We ignore the bulky reference material but un-ignore what the build needs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# melda / style-guide are not imported by src -> keep fully ignored.
melda/
style-guide/

# gypsa: ignore everything, then re-include only the files src/ imports.
gypsa/*
!gypsa/Milestones.md
!gypsa/Approved Reference/
gypsa/Approved Reference/*
